Commerce polish: fix IG publishing, creative reels, product-first carousels, batch snap overhaul

Instagram Publishing:
- Smart parallel container polling for carousels (20min -> 2min worst case)
- HTTPS URL validation + _resolve_absolute_media_urls helper
- Container readiness polling for single images and carousel parent
- Recovery task race fix (bump updated_at before retry)
- Generic carousel URLs resolved via _public_url_for_file

Reels (creative, not just sliding photos):
- Text hook overlays burned into first/last frames (product name + price CTA)
- flash_commerce template (1.8s rapid cuts for Explore algorithm)
- story_arc template (problem -> reveal -> benefits -> CTA)
- Photoroom channel_story 9:16 preference (skip blur-letterbox)
- Background blur reduced, foreground enlarged

Carousels (product visible):
- New clean_split layout (72% product / 28% text bar)
- New side_panel layout (58% product / 42% text panel)
- New minimal_caption layout (full photo + 10% strip)
- Benefit slides rotate product-first layouts
- All gradient overlays reduced to not cover products

Batch Snap (Market Day):
- Parallel Photoroom via ThreadPoolExecutor(4 workers)
- Auto carousel + reel creation per batch item
- Per-item failure tracking on session.error_message
- Showcase reel uses polished images + proper post fields
- Fixed missing social_account/post_format on reel posts

Infrastructure:
- publish_post soft_time_limit raised to 360s
- recover_stuck_publishing_posts periodic task (10 min)
- Celery Beat schedule entry added
